# Cloudflare reads this file and applies the headers to matching routes.
#
# Cross-origin isolation is what unlocks multi-threaded WASM inference
# (SharedArrayBuffer, shared via crossOriginIsolated). Without it, browsers
# without WebGPU fall back to single-threaded WASM, which is several times
# slower.
#
# `require-corp` means every subresource must be same-origin or carry an
# explicit CORP header. This app only loads its own assets, so that is fine —
# but if you later add a third-party font or CDN script, revisit this.

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

/models/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/ort/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
